# Moonshaker Cavalry: "When this creature enters, creatures you control gain flying and get +X/+X until end of turn, where X is
# the number of creatures you control." Turn 1 Bot1 casts a Memnite, five Moxen and a Black Lotus; turn 3 it draws and casts the
# Cavalry ({5}{W}{W}{W}: the Lotus's three white and the five Moxen, pool empty). Bot1 controls two creatures, the Memnite and the
# Cavalry, so X is 2 - Bot2's Ornithopter is no creature "you control" and neither counts nor is pumped: the Memnite is a 3/3
# flyer and the Cavalry an 8/8 flyer. On Bot2's turn both are back to 1/1 and 6/6.

